{"id":"n82631-2-4","stage":4,"title":"틀어막다 · 封住","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82631-2-4-1","ko":"비밀은 지켜져야 해.","zh":"秘密必须得保密啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비밀은","meaning":"秘密","explanation":"비밀：秘密；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"비밀","audio":"/audio/00897c8f8b298fae0a09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66309","senseId":"1","lemma":"비밀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비밀은","audio":"/audio/643e88a876624f5dd4f2.mp3"}},{"text":"지켜져야","meaning":"守护，保卫；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"지키다：守护，保卫；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"지키다","audio":"/audio/43f3170b8d3dc6fa99c2.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29754","senseId":"1","lemma":"지키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지켜져야","audio":"/audio/a1be49c4d27ba6d2aa81.mp3"}},{"text":"해.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"00897c8f8b298fae","term":"비밀","zh":"秘密","audio":"/audio/00897c8f8b298fae0a09.mp3","entryId":"66309","definition":"隐秘而不为人知的事情。","pronunciation":["비ː밀"]},{"id":"43f3170b8d3dc6fa","term":"지키다","zh":"守护，保卫","audio":"/audio/43f3170b8d3dc6fa99c2.mp3","entryId":"29754","definition":"为了使财产、利益、安全等不丢失或遭受外界的侵犯而保护或监视并阻止。","pronunciation":["지키다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","au